  "releaseNotes": "Version 16.0.0.63934:\n\n• Improved import of DWG/DXF:\n    - mproved support for CADACISEntity\n• Improved export of DWG\n• New measuring tools: Distance, Polyline Length, and Area. The tools are customizable\n• Updated demo examples:\n    - a new demo, UseMeasuresDemo, illustrating how to use and customize the measuring tools;\n    - upgraded EditorControl and ViewerControl functions. Now the controls include the measuring tools;\n    - added measuring tools to EditorDemo in the .NET Core build.\n• Updated a .NET6 build up .NET8.\n• Bug fixes",
